# Instructor-owned paths. A PR touching any of these automatically requests the
# instructor's review. GitHub branch protection is not available on this plan,
# so this file requests a review; it does not block a merge. The merge
# rule (CI passes, one human approves) is a course rule, held by the instructor
# merging only through PRs.
# Student routes (covers/<slug>/) are deliberately NOT listed: the teams own them,
# and the one human approval the course rule asks for can come from a peer.
# covers/registry.json is shared: every team adds exactly one object.

/src/               @ruvebal
/scripts/           @ruvebal
/public/            @ruvebal
/covers/_studio/    @ruvebal
/covers/_template/  @ruvebal
/.github/           @ruvebal
/.cursor/           @ruvebal
/CODEOWNERS         @ruvebal
/README.md          @ruvebal
/CONTRIBUTING.md    @ruvebal
/index.html         @ruvebal
/.gitignore         @ruvebal
/package.json       @ruvebal
/package-lock.json  @ruvebal
/vite.config.js     @ruvebal
/eslint.config.js   @ruvebal
